      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100010000002.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> １．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai44_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>泣<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて いるんですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Anh/chị khóc đấy à?</div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… いいえ、<ruby>笑<rp>(</rp><rt>わら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いすぎて、<ruby>涙<rp>(</rp><rt>なみだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たんです。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">…Không, tôi cười quá, chảy cả nước mắt.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> ２．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai44_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>最近<rp>(</rp><rt>さいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>操作<rp>(</rp><rt>そうさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>簡単<rp>(</rp><rt>かんたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですね。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ô-tô gần đây thao tác đơn giản nhỉ.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… ええ。でも、<ruby>簡単<rp>(</rp><rt>かんたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すぎて、<ruby>運転<rp>(</rp><rt>うんてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が おもしろくないです</span>。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">…Vâng. Nhưng mà đơn giản quá nên việc lái xe không thú vị.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> ３．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai44_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>田舎<rp>(</rp><rt>いなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と <ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と、どちらが <ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みやすいですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Nhà quê và khu phố , nơi nào dễ sống hơn?</div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… <ruby>田舎<rp>(</rp><rt>いなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の ほうが <ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みやすいと <ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">…Tôi nghĩ là nhà quê dễ sống hơn.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>物価<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も <ruby>安<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いし、<ruby>空気<rp>(</rp><rt>くうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も きれいですから。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vì nhà quê giá rẻ hơn và không khí cũng trong lành hơn.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> ４．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai44_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">この コップは <ruby>丈夫<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れにくいですよ。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cái cốc này bền và khó vỡ lắm.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">… こどもが <ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うのに <ruby>安全<rp>(</rp><rt>あんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で、いいですね。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">…Cho trẻ con dùng thì an toàn và tốt nhỉ.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p> <p> ５．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai44_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">もう <ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>遅<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いですから、<ruby>静<rp>(</rp><rt>しず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かに して いただけませんか。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vì đã muộn rồi nên làm ơn giữ yên tĩnh được không ạ?</div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">… はい。すみません。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">… Vâng, xin lỗi.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> ６．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai44_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に しますか。 </div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Đồ uống bạn chọn gì nhỉ?</div></div></div><p></p> <p> 